          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-gold-500/10 border border-gold-500/30 text-gold-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4 shadow-sm"
        >
          <Award class="w-4 h-4 text-gold-400" /> Pilihan Paket & Investasi Diri
        </div> -->

