            class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-gold-300 via-yellow-400 to-gold-500 drop-shadow-[0_0_25px_rgba(212,175,55,0.3)]"
          >
            Innerpeace Public Speaking
          </span>
        </h1>

        <p
          class="text-slate-300 text-base sm:text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed"
        >
